{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23343","headline":"吴中好风景二首 一 · 白居易","name":"吴中好风景二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴中好风景，八月如三月。\n水荇叶仍香，木莲花未歇。\n海天微雨散，江郭纤埃灭。\n暑退衣服乾，潮生船舫活。\n两衙渐多暇，亭午初无热。\n骑吏语使君，正是游时节。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}